t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0a0cc0a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"0a0cc0a\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7c1ff06\" data-id=\"7c1ff06\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb37311 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fb37311\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To promote the Triple Helix Model, the Cambodia University of Technology and Science (CamTech) and the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology, and Innovation (MISTI) co-hosted a multidisciplinary and multi-stakeholder consultation workshop on \u201cCambodia National Technology Roadmap for Education 2021 \u2013 2030: Enhancing Education with Technology\u201d On December 01, 2021 with support from the Science and Technology Policy Institute (STEPI) of South Korea. The consultation workshop was participated by relevant stakeholders from various backgrounds and representatives from EdTech Committee, the National Council for Science, Technology, and Innovation, research institutes, universities, private sectors, practitioners, school leadership, government officials, and students. The purpose of the workshop was to identify and gather input for vision, goals, strategic products and services, and key advanced technologies to support the diffusion of technology in the Cambodian educational sector.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Four areas of educational technology, namely The Essentials, Management System, Enhancing Apparatus, and Capacity Building have been identified as the pillar of focus. Additionally, all stakeholders have come to an agreement that active collaboration among universities, industry, and government is of great significance in steering the development and implementation of the national roadmap to achieve desirable outcomes. It is CamTech\u2019s privilege to undertake this prestigious task to develop the Cambodia National Technology Roadmap and contribute to the ongoing efforts in promoting education innovation in the country.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-57c8d2c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"57c8d2c\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-95274a7\" data-id=\"95274a7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e68277 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"7e68277\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\